        "id": "b1d7c0a2e4f35a91",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "Redbox",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "The flow Redbox is installed with.\n\nThe **Edgeberry Platform** group is what makes this box show up as an\napplication on the device interface: the *Application info* message carries the\nname, version and links, and the *Application status* message carries the health\nlight. Keep them wired up, and edit the name, version and routes to whatever\nthis box becomes.\n\nEverything else here is a starting point. Wire up whatever you like.",
        "env": []
    },
