    {
        "id": "c48a1f6b2d09e735",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "b1d7c0a2e4f35a91",
        "name": "Edgeberry Platform",
        "info": "The device interface reads an application's name, version, description and\nlinks from the 'info' message below - edgeberry.json only says where the\napplication lives and which port to proxy. Without these two injects the box\nruns, but the device interface has nothing to show for it.\n\nBoth inject nodes fire once at startup. They fire again whenever Edgeberry\nCore is restarted only if Node-RED is restarted too, so redeploy after\nreinstalling Edgeberry.",
        "x": 160,
        "y": 60,
        "wires": []
    },
